# LF on every platform. Worker bundles, manifests, reports and workflows are
# hashed or compared byte for byte (evaluated-runtime registry, dashboard,
# cohort locks); a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true, the Windows default)
# changes those bytes and breaks 12 tests.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.gz binary
*.task binary
*.tflite binary
*.wasm binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
